UPDATE public.ac_backgrounds SET source = 'HTA', ruleset = '2014', category = 'Homebrew', feature = 'Wilderness Adept', notes_advice = 'This homebrew background was created by rexen

The Fallen Cloaks were a band of people led by Rigard "Windhowler" Vanderholt. They used the environment to ward off the terrors of the lands before the Crimson King''s forces annihilated them. Their council has now retired back to the wilderness and they are no longer active. For a reasonable period, you served as a brigand and raided villages and caravans to survive. Your time as a Fallen Cloak has given you plenty of experience in survival and adapting to the environment. These particular set of skills have become useful for traversing the wilderness as a guide or hunter and using the terrain to your advantage in fights and survival.

Skill Proficiencies. Stealth, Survival
Tool Proficiencies. Leatherworker''s Tools, Weaver''s Tools
Equipment. A set of traveling clothes, a hunting trap, a cloak adapted to a natural environment of your choice, explorer''s pack and a belt pouch containing 10 gp.

Background Feature: Wilderness Adept
You know how to survive in many environments, lay the perfect ambush, and how to adapt the terrain to your advantage. Within natural environments, you can gather nearby materials to camouflage your cloak to avoid being seen, and you can communicate with other Fallen Cloak survivors without being heard by using a secret sign language.', display_order = 38 WHERE id = '2e6d71fd-13f5-4e56-8093-c2be7deb797a'::uuid OR (name = 'Fallen Cloak Survivor' AND display_order = 38);
